## 书法作品版权声明 / Calligraphy Artwork Copyright Notice

本项目中使用的书法作品图片仅供学习和研究使用。

The calligraphy artwork images used in this project are for educational and 
research purposes only.

### 版权状态 / Copyright Status

- 如果您是作品的版权所有者并认为您的权利受到侵犯，请联系我们，我们将立即删除相关内容。
- If you are the copyright owner of any artwork and believe your rights have 
  been infringed, please contact us and we will remove the content immediately.

### 使用限制 / Usage Restrictions

- 本项目中的书法作品图片不得用于商业用途
- The calligraphy artwork images in this project may not be used for 
  commercial purposes
- 使用者应遵守相关版权法律法规
- Users should comply with relevant copyright laws and regulations

### 联系方式 / Contact

如有版权问题，请通过 GitHub Issues 联系我们。
For copyright issues, please contact us through GitHub Issues.
